              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-24">
              <num>24</num>
              <heading>At the end of subsection 168(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-24__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>; and (c)	to advise and make recommendations to TEQSA about:</p>
                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-24__qstr-1__para-i">
                  <num>i</num>
